<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Dwagun!&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">October 26. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">That's right! We just can't leave them alone!! Tormax made us do
it! Yea yea, excuses, we did it alright. Zlandicar took a dirt nap, and blessed
us with perhaps some of the best loot he ever dropped. No less than 2!! TWO
Cowls of Mortality! Grats Xxendark and Phayla on CoM, Pullem on Fradakar's
Talisman, Ord on his heart and myself on his ST talisman! Grats to all the
winners!</p>
<p align="center">What began as this...</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Zland1.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">Ended like this...</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Zlandicarsmall.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">Think even the bard got the killshot...</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Zlandloot.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">Pwease drop this next time too :D</p>
<p align="left">Grats to all the winners, and especially Xxendark on his new
bird helm :P *giggle*</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Birdhelm.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">I CAN FLYYYYYYYYYYYYYY!</p>
<p align="left">Other than that, we took down Nathyn again, granting our 4th
robe to our chanters, Grats Adreiana on her Robe of Dark Beguilement!</p>
<p align="left">And in the true spirit of Darksphere, we engaged Lcea Katta,
with all 22 could give her! Result? Darksphere 2 - Lcea Katta 0!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Lcealoot.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">Grats Goson on Amulet, Orduhre on VT key piece and Aveda on<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/GirdleofMagnificence.jpg"><p align="left">And
as promised, I present to you our latest rez stick cleric - Taliara.<p align="center"><img border="0" src="TaliEpic.jpg"><p align="center">GRATS!!!<p align="left"><b>Quote
I'm glad I wasn't a part of :P</b><p align="left">Said it before, said it again
- I'm SO glad I aint the main tank :D I response to Kats CH when we took on Lcea,
Vikos had this comment<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/145.jpg"><p align="left">To
which our fearless leader only replies...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/146.jpg"><p align="left">No
comment :P<p align="left">Until next time Heros!<p align="center">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Killing spree!&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">October 23. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">Wow! That's like the only word that describes the past 3 days in
Darksphere :) First of all, Grats Ord and Treelow on 60 and Vikos and Tay on 61
:) Many more of you close to this, so keep it going! :)</p>
<p align="left">To sum it up, this is about what happened.</p>
<p align="left">Sunday: Darksphere 2 - Vindicator 0. Grats Vikos on your new BP
:) Flawless run, not a single death like it's supposed to be! Va'Dyn first kill
for us, grats to all the winners there! Late that night, less that 3 Darksphere
groups took out our other friend Zelnithak, grats again to the winners! :D</p>
<p align="left">Monday: Buh bye Praetorian Myral, Nathyn and last but not least
- Velketor the Sorcerer!!! Yep, that traitor of a giant took a dirt nap to no
less than 28 brave Darksphere souls put this bird to sleep! Lag, as usual after
a patch, was insane, with constant 5k pings, MT going LD during fight, CH macros
5 seconds delayed... oh well, takes ALOT more to stop us when we put our mind to
it! :) Grats Ferlos on Robe and Crystal, Kulack on Book!</p>
<p align="left">Tuesday: Another patch, surprise surprise! Wuoshi up... and
down! 3 scales, blades and 4 spells, grats to all the winners!&nbsp;<br>
Darksphere 3 - Vindicator 0 :D Thanks for yet another BP you cheap bastard,
where are the rest!?! We'll be back for more! Grats Kangazcon on your BP this
time, you fought hard for it :) 28 people - nice job Darksphere!!!<br>
And yes, you guessed it!! Darksphere 2 - Velketor 0!!! :P Neener neener, less
lag this time, but still insane, fell to no less than 25 this time, getting
trivial :P Grats Nolon on robe, Trinko on Book, Kulack on Ring and Korisa on
mask!</p>
<p align="center">BEWARE THE BOOT OF VELKETOR!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/VelketortheSorcerersmall.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">And the left one too :P</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/VelketortheSorcerersmall2.jpg"></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Velkloot.jpg"><img border="0" src="Kills/Velkloot2.jpg" align="top"></p>
<p align="center">I gotta put myself in xp group so I can get the lootshots :D
(did I say that out loud?)</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/Toetwister.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">Grats Kienn :)</p>
<p align="left">GRATS DARKSPHERE!! You really showed the world what we are made
of these last few days!! Much more to come!</p>
<p align="left"><b>Quote(s) of the week.</b></p>
<p align="left">This is like clerics covering their mana bar when they are in CH
rot, just hoping it will last through the fight :D</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/144.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">/em glad he aint the one that MTs :P</p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left">Good job guys, untill next time!</p>


<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">&nbsp;<br>
Quack Quack!&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">October 20. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">Well what do ya know :) Darksphere got it's own duck!! That its
a skull duck on the top of a stick, with something looking like disco light
coming out of it, is a totally different story :P</p>
<p align="left">A huge congratulations to Senya, for completing one of the
hardest epics in the game!! Woooooot!</p>
<p align="left">Another huge grats to Taliara for completing her Water
sprinkler, giving over 50% of all our clerics rez sticks!! Woot!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="SenyaEpic.jpg" width="420" height="560"></p>
<p align="center">GRATS SENYA!!! QUACK QUACK!</p>
<p align="center">/tell Tayen that shield cost her 200dkp, she agreed to that
/nod</p>
<p align="left">And sowwy Tali, didn't have a chance to take a pic of your epic
yet, but I will at next raid I promise, or I will make someone do it :P</p>
<p align="left">That's it! Just deserved an update :P&nbsp;</p>


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Yes another update, and no I'm not sick :D&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">October 13. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">Woo! Doomshade DOOOWWWNN!! Yep that's right! Moved to Kael to
make a quick kill, buh bye Keldor, grats me on your shield :P Moved to Katta,
spend 10 mins dealing out 1 million dmg to Nathyn, buh bye, grats Carpe on his
robe! =) Raced to UP, wasted Fire fast, buh bye, grats Pullem on Knuckle
Dusters, grats Trinko on int bracelet!.</p>
<p align="left">Then it was Doomshades time to go BUH BYE! Wanted him for a
loooong time, and now he finally took a dirt nap! We had a few problems with 40+
spectators lagging the crap out of us, causing massive LDs, forcing us to zone
him. Get back, prepped in no time and engaged him again. And what do you know,
MT LD again, yay, but no worries, we got plenty to switch to :P Awesome work
tanks and clerics!! The result:</p>
<p align="center">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="center"><a href="Kills/Doomshade.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/Doomshadesmall.jpg" width="512" height="384"></a></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Doomshadeloot.jpg" width="116" height="244"></p>
<p align="left">Grats Goson on your new ubba bow!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/BowofDoom.jpg" width="403" height="193"></p>
<p align="left">Jawash on your new blade</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/MithrilEdgedShortSword.jpg" width="403" height="194"></p>
<p align="left">And Aumamdar on your new hammer, which this slacka shaman of
course not didn't take a picture off =(&nbsp; /selfbonk times 2. Grats!! Also,
Grats Vixie on Bracelet of Quickness!!</p>
<p align="left">That was the minor part of the update, here comes the important
one! I GOT A QUOTE! :D</p>
<p align="left"><b>Quote #1 in a looooooong time!!</b></p>
<p align="left">HELL YEA!!! This one knows what its all about! :D (never found
out who it is :)</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/143.jpg" width="246" height="14"><br>
<img border="0" src="Quotes/143.jpg" width="246" height="14"></p>
<p align="left">:D</p>
<p align="left">That's it for tonight guys, c ya tomorrow for some more action!</p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Give me some quotes dammit! :P&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">October 12. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">Phew! A few other things happened in Darksphere the last couple
of days that deserve an update! Servitor ate the dust again, piece of cake, so
we decided to move on to Katta Castelum and pick a fight with the bosses there!
Surprise surprise - we won! :D Nathyn Illuminious, dead!! Lcea Katta, dead! And
might I just add, these two got TONS of hitpoints! But as we all know... it's
only a matter of time :D</p>
<p align="left">Grats Trinko on your new ubba 100cha robe!&nbsp;</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/RobeofDarkBeguilement.jpg" width="402" height="190"></p>
<p align="left"> Bgret and Nova on
this staff.</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/KataStaffofPeace.jpg" width="401" height="190"></p>
<p align="center">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left">As I said in the previous update, Akx got his epic and I
promised you a pic bro, so here it is! :) Grats again :)</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="AkxEpic.jpg" width="248" height="420"></p>
<p align="center">GRATS DR00D!</p>
<p align="left">Yet again we ventured to SF to take down the good oll Ragefire,
poor little dragon! Got us another rez stick, with two more inc before we know
it! Grats Khanlya on your Water Sprinkler!!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="KhanEpic.jpg" width="243" height="411"></p>
<p align="center">GRATS!!</p>
<p align="left"><b>Quotes of the week:</b></p>
<p align="left">There is none!!!! /cry</p>
<p align="left">damn, make some stupid moves ppl :D</p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">You refer to the one who will bring balance to
the force?&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">October 9. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">Well, it happened again :) Darksphere got yet another Warrior
epic this week, and life in this guild have been a Star Wars movie since then! A
huge Congratulations to Bragnar for finally completing his Warrior epic!!
Wooohoooo! Been doing that ever since they were first introduced! Grats Jedi,
now tell me, who is who with you and Vikos? Who is the padawan and who is the
master? /grin</p>
<p align="center"><b>Veteran Bragnar Frostbane<br>
&lt;Darksphere&gt;</b></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="BragEpic.jpg" width="425" height="427"></p>
<p align="center">GRATS JEDI!!!!!</p>
<p align="left">Also a BIG Grats to Akxion for completing his Leafblower!!!
GRATS!!! Sorry, but I didn't get a chance to take a pic =/ Promise ya one on
next update! :)</p>
<p align="left">All in all a good few last days here at Darksphere, got a
whopping 35 pieces of armor at our last 2 ToV raids!! WOOT! Including 1 Plate
BP, Chain BP, 5 plate legs and finally, FINALLY Leather legs for Tay! Grats!! :)
Grats to all the winners!</p>
<p align="left">Oh, and we dropped Servitor of Luclin again :P grats to all the
winners there! Kamaya on blade and Diest on dagger if I remember correctly!</p>
<p align="left">Untill next time kids, take care!</p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>


                          <p>&nbsp;


<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Derakor the Vindicator... DOWN!!!&nbsp;</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">October 5. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">WOOOHOOOO!! Finally we get a clean shot at Vindi, with the right
force assembled to take him DOWN!! Woot! Grats Darksphere! Damn it feels good to
kill Giants for a change :D Awesome work on the CH line, perfect as usual!
Perfect agro control from our MTs, agro never left him and rampage stayed on the
other! What more can you ask for?? Oh yea, VI, plz, stop with all that server
lag and chat channel crashes plz, k tnx, kikou!! Anyways, Vindi is down!!!
Dead!! Took yet another dirt nap!! Yet that poor bastard didn't even wanna give
us a new pair of shoes.... /rude!</p>
<p align="left">Grats Gruz on your new ubba BP!!! Woot!!!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="GruzVindiBP.jpg" width="279" height="410"></p>
<p align="center">GRATS!!!</p>
<p align="center"><a href="Kills/Vindicator.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/Vindicatorsmall.jpg" width="409" height="357"></a></p>
<p align="center">AWWWWWW!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Vindiloot.jpg" width="125" height="168"></p>
<p align="center">Cheap cheap cheap!!! Could at least have dropped 2 pieces of
meat!!</p>
<p align="center">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left">Oh, and buh bye Servitor too, got him yesterday, joke of a
fight, but you gotta love that zone :D Didn't even take a killshot of him /sigh,
slacka shaman! Got loot though :D Grats Entremi and Aumamdar on your new blades!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Servitorloot.jpg" width="130" height="178"></p>
<p align="center">Pfft!</p>
<p align="left">Awesome couple of days, more goodies to come!!! :D</p>
<p align="left"><b>Quick quote or two</b></p>
<p align="left">Vikos, I always wondered, how do you get to PoG?</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/141.jpg" width="462" height="26"></p>
<p align="left">Yea riiiigghhtt...</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/142.jpg" width="473" height="29"></p>
<p align="left">hmmmk. As long as they MT good, I don't care :D</p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left">Untill next time folks, have fun!!</p>


